Hello, this is Sumanth. Today marks Day 12 of my Cloud Architect journey.
Date : 23-05-2026
Day : Saturday

GOAL:
Revision and reinforcement of all concepts learned from Day 8 to Day 11 to strengthen retention, improve practical understanding, and build confidence in cloud architecture fundamentals.

====================================================
DAY 8 REVISION — LINUX ADMINISTRATION
====================================================

1. User Management

Commands:
useradd
passwd
userdel
usermod
su
sudo su
groups
id

Examples:
sudo useradd devuser
sudo passwd devuser
sudo usermod -aG sudo devuser
sudo userdel -r devuser

Purpose:
Reinforce Linux user administration skills.


2. File Permissions

Commands:
chmod
chown
ls -l

Examples:
chmod 755 script.sh
chmod 644 config.txt
chmod u+x deploy.sh
sudo chown sumanth:sumanth file.txt

Concepts:
r = read
w = write
x = execute
setuid
setgid
sticky bit

Purpose:
Strengthen Linux security fundamentals.


3. Process Management

Commands:
ps
ps aux
top
htop
pgrep
kill
kill -9
pkill
nice
renice

Examples:
pgrep nginx
kill 1234
pkill python
nice -n 10 sleep 100

Purpose:
Manage and troubleshoot running processes.


4. Background Jobs

Commands:
&
nohup
jobs
fg
bg
disown

Examples:
sleep 300 &
nohup python app.py &
jobs

Purpose:
Understand background execution workflows.


